  "children": [],
  "designMd": {
    "raw": "# Design System: Faz\n\nFaz is a personal GTD PWA built with Tailwind CSS v4 + DaisyUI v5. Every colour in a design must come\nfrom a DaisyUI theme token so mockups follow the theme picker. The app ships all 35 DaisyUI themes (default `light`); this file carries `light` and `dark`.\n\n## 1. Visual Theme & Atmosphere\n\nCalm, compact, mobile-first lists. Page background is `base-300`, cards and bars are `base-100`,\nsecondary surfaces `base-200`. One accent colour per screen: `primary`.\n\n## 2. Color Palette & Roles\n\nVariables mirror DaisyUI token names (Tailwind class without the `bg-`/`text-` prefix). Theme axis\n`theme` holds DaisyUI theme names (`light`, `dark`, ...).\n\n- **base-100** — cards, top bar, modals (`bg-base-100`)\n- **base-200** — secondary surfaces, inputs, chips (`bg-base-200`)\n- **base-300** — page background, borders (`bg-base-300`, `border-base-300`)\n- **base-content** — main text and icons (`text-base-content`)\n- **base-content-flat/40** — muted text (`text-base-content/40`), solid, exact on base-100\n- **base-content-flat/50**, **/60**, **/30**, **/20** — other muted levels\n- **base-content-flat/10** — dividers and hairlines (`bg-base-content/10`, DaisyUI `.divider`)\n- **base-content/NN** — true-alpha versions; use only for text (OpenPencil 0.8.4 exports render shape-fill alpha too light)\n- **primary** / **primary-content** — main action, active states, brand tick\n- **secondary**, **accent**, **neutral** (+ `-content`) — DaisyUI roles, used sparingly\n- **success**, **warning**, **error**, **info** (+ `-content`) — status\n\n## 3. Typography Rules\n\n**Primary Font Family:** Inter (400, 500, 600). Sizes: 12, 13, 14, 16, 20.\n\n## 4. Component Stylings\n\n- Cards, modals: corner radius `radius-box` (light/dark: 8)\n- Buttons, inputs: corner radius `radius-field` (light/dark: 4); FAB and pills are fully rounded\n- Badges, checkboxes, toggles: `radius-selector` (light/dark: 8)\n- Borders: `border` px (1) in `base-300`\n- Primary actions on the right: `cancel | save`\n- Icons: lucide\n\n## 5. Layout Principles\n\nMobile frame 390 wide. Dock nav at the bottom. Spacing on the Tailwind 4px scale.",
    "projectName": "Faz",
    "visualTheme": "Calm, compact, mobile-first lists. Page background is `base-300`, cards and bars are `base-100`,\nsecondary surfaces `base-200`. One accent colour per screen: `primary`.",
    "typography": {
      "fontFamily": "Inter (400, 500, 600). Sizes: 12, 13, 14, 16, 20.",
      "scale": "**Primary Font Family:** Inter (400, 500, 600). Sizes: 12, 13, 14, 16, 20."
    },
    "componentStyles": "- Cards, modals: corner radius `radius-box` (light/dark: 8)\n- Buttons, inputs: corner radius `radius-field` (light/dark: 4); FAB and pills are fully rounded\n- Badges, checkboxes, toggles: `radius-selector` (light/dark: 8)\n- Borders: `border` px (1) in `base-300`\n- Primary actions on the right: `cancel | save`\n- Icons: lucide",
    "layoutPrinciples": "Mobile frame 390 wide. Dock nav at the bottom. Spacing on the Tailwind 4px scale."
  },
